<title>AUSTRALIA: India to discuss wheat in Australia this week-AWB.</title>
<headline>India to discuss wheat in Australia this week-AWB.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>India is not threatening to refuse to accept shipments of Australian wheat over alleged weed content &quot;at this stage&quot; but will send Agriculture Ministry officials to Australia for discussions this week, an Australian Wheat Board (AWB) spokesman told Reuters.</p>
</text>
